{"4161700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VELTHRA", "steam_appid": 4161700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌿 WELCOME TO VELTHRA — A WORLD WORTH SURVIVING FOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Velthra is a <strong>low-poly survival game</strong> set in a vast, procedurally generated world filled with wildlife, ancient civilizations, harsh climates, deep dungeons, and dynamic ecosystems.<br>You awaken on a forgotten shore—cold, hungry, alone—and must learn how to endure the world before you can conquer it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival isn’t just about gathering food. It’s about understanding the environment, mastering tools, forming bonds with animals, and preparing for the unknown dangers hidden beneath the earth and above the mountains.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔥 MAIN FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Multi-Style Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-Down</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third-Person</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full support for <strong>mouse</strong>, <strong>keyboard</strong>, <strong>gamepad</strong>, and <strong>mobile-style touch controls</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch freely between perspectives depending on what your adventure demands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧰 Deep Survival &amp; Crafting Systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Velthra features a <strong>fully-fledged survival loop</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory &amp; equipment system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting (tools, weapons, armor, food, structures)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Durability &amp; spoilage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character needs: <strong>health, hunger, thirst, temperature</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming crops and gathering seeds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking advanced meals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storage chests &amp; base expansion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tool you craft changes your ability to survive. Every meal you cook affects your stats and resistances.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌲 A Living Low-Poly Ecosystem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animals behave based on realistic AI:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander and graze</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flee from danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt and chase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form groups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Threaten or avoid players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt deer for food, avoid wolves at night, challenge a bear when you’re ready—or tame loyal animal companions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐾 Pets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, tame, and grow companions with unique behaviors:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack targets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig buried items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect you from wild beasts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each pet has its own stats, moods, and bond level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚔️ Combat &amp; Hunting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face wild animals and natural threats:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wolves, bears, boars, diseased creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee combat: sword, axe, spear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged combat: bow &amp; arrow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps, fire pits, crafted protections</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is skill-based, requiring timing, movement, and preparation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌡 Temperature &amp; Weather System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freezing snow biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burning deserts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain, fog, storms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/Night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heat and cold sources (torches, campfires, shelters, clothing)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world reacts to time: predators become more aggressive at night, and temperatures drop dangerously.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌍 Procedurally Generated World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two worlds are the same:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forests, mountains, lakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frozen tundras</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert ruins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fertile plains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden valleys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subterranean caverns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random resource placement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather and fauna variety</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new game = new survival story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏛 Civilization Zones &amp; NPC Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover abandoned and living settlements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruined villages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tribal camps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgotten temples</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient libraries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrior outposts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some hold secrets. Some hold danger. Some offer trade, quests, or lost knowledge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🕳 Dungeons &amp; Dark Places</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysterious underground world:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark tunnels and crypts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly beasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient technology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure rooms</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare before entering—you may not come back alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⏳ Game Clock &amp; Seasonal Feel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic clock influences:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animal behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temperature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvesting speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleep &amp; stamina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel safety</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night is deadly. Dawn is hopeful.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💾 Save &amp; Load System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survival story persists:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manual and automatic saving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple save slots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World state is preserved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character, base, pets, crops, durability—all saved</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⭐⭐ Leveling &amp; Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn XP from:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gathering</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your character’s abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resistance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource yield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet handling</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛡 Bonus Effects &amp; Consumables</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find or craft special items that temporarily boost:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heat resistance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry capacity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accuracy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival efficiency</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎨 Low-Poly Visual Identity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clean, atmospheric low-poly art style including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated male &amp; female characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bears, wolves, deer, rabbits, squirrels, birds, bees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of hand-crafted objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D icons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully stylized environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful. Calm. Deadly when it needs to be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌟 Your Survival. Your World. Your Story.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Velthra is not just a game—you write your own survival story.<br>Build a home, tame animals, explore forgotten places, fight the cold, master the wilderness…<br>and discover the ancient secrets hiding beneath the low-poly surface.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌿 WELCOME TO VELTHRA — A WORLD WORTH SURVIVING FOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Velthra is a <strong>low-poly survival game</strong> set in a vast, procedurally gene